WEBVTT

00:00:06.008 --> 00:00:09.261
Coach → Methods & rules: the texts and rules your AI coach follows.

00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:14.031
A change waiting for you shows only the changed lines, with a little context, and the reason.

00:00:14.081 --> 00:00:16.795
The full text is one click away.

00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:22.708
Outdated names, rule ranges and fixed thresholds VibeSynergy fixes itself. Here you see afterwards what changed.

00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:28.452
One click undoes it; the change log keeps every version.
